<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador bank liquidity up 0.87 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Ecuador bank liquidity up 0.87 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's Central Bank said Tuesday liquidity in the banking system grew 0.87 percent or 167 million sucres to 19.25 billion sucres in April.</p>
<p>At the end of March, bank liquidity stood at 19.09 billion sucres.</p>
<p>Total liquidity in the banking sector ended 1996 at 16.99 billion sucres, up 35.8 percent from 1995.</p>
<p>((--Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433))</p>
</text>
